WEBVTT

00:48.673 --> 00:51.134
This is your last warning. Drop the gun.

00:51.217 --> 00:54.512
All right. Fine.

00:54.596 --> 00:55.430
Here it is.

00:56.347 --> 00:57.432
Sir, are you okay?

00:59.976 --> 01:01.227
Yes, Captain Joo is okay.

01:42.018 --> 01:44.979
This is your last warning. Drop the gun.

01:49.317 --> 01:50.151
Hey.

01:51.903 --> 01:54.489
Wow, seriously. I can't believe it.

01:54.572 --> 01:56.991
What made you even think to go in there?

01:57.075 --> 01:57.909
Come on, man.

01:58.409 --> 02:02.622
Anything for a scoop, right?
It was nothing.

02:02.705 --> 02:04.791
Man, you've still got it.

02:06.084 --> 02:07.377
- By the way…
- Yeah?

02:08.002 --> 02:10.505
Have you ever really seen a gun like that?

02:11.005 --> 02:12.215
No, I haven't. Why?

02:13.842 --> 02:15.677
My hunches are usually spot on.

02:16.261 --> 02:17.929
The incident at that gosiwon too.

02:20.515 --> 02:22.142
I'm sure there are more of them.

02:23.184 --> 02:26.437
If there are, bring me
a couple more exclusives like this.

02:26.521 --> 02:27.814
And if I do?

02:27.897 --> 02:31.818
If you do, I'll do everything I can
to get you a permanent role.

02:31.901 --> 02:34.487
And an office with a view
to make you feel at home.

02:34.571 --> 02:36.114
An office with a view?

02:36.197 --> 02:37.699
A panoramic view, okay?

02:38.992 --> 02:39.909
Keep your word.

02:40.827 --> 02:42.203
A panoramic view. Okay?

02:44.455 --> 02:46.207
An office with a view…

03:03.683 --> 03:04.809
Breaking news.

03:04.893 --> 03:07.437
On November 21,
a horrific shooting occurred

03:07.520 --> 03:10.148
when Jeon,
after cutting off his ankle monitor,

03:10.231 --> 03:14.444
went to Gyeongin Seobu Police Station
and opened fire indiscriminately.

03:14.944 --> 03:19.073
He appears to have struck at night,
exploiting the lack of on-duty officers…

03:19.157 --> 03:20.158
Awesome.

03:21.534 --> 03:25.038
The suspect was shot and killed by police
while being apprehended,

03:25.622 --> 03:28.416
which has sparked yet another controversy.

03:31.586 --> 03:33.087
PURCHASE A GUN

03:33.171 --> 03:34.714
WE'RE GIVING AWAY GUNS! FREE GUN

03:43.431 --> 03:46.184
GYEONGIN SEOBU POLICE STATION

03:51.940 --> 03:54.901
You got the gun from the evidence room.

03:56.819 --> 03:59.155
Then where were all those bullets from?

03:59.739 --> 04:02.367
There were no bullets
on the evidence list.

04:03.785 --> 04:08.998
You got the bullets from Mr. Moon Baek,
who accompanied you to the scene, right?

04:09.707 --> 04:11.542
You first met him at the house?

04:12.043 --> 04:12.877
Yes.

04:12.961 --> 04:14.545
But why did you go there?

04:14.629 --> 04:18.758
Well, I already told that guy everything.

04:19.968 --> 04:21.469
Where did he go?

04:22.053 --> 04:23.054
Told who?

04:24.430 --> 04:25.265
All right.

04:25.932 --> 04:28.851
I'll just tell you the whole truth
from the start.

04:28.935 --> 04:31.646
Mr. Moon Baek said you took the bullets

04:32.146 --> 04:34.357
he was going to report to the police.

04:35.316 --> 04:38.778
What is your relationship
with Mr. Moon Baek?

04:39.988 --> 04:41.406
We met by chance.

04:41.489 --> 04:43.116
It was an urgent situation…

04:45.201 --> 04:46.035
so he helped.

04:53.710 --> 04:57.463
Tell us what happened
when you took down Jeon Won-seong.

04:59.007 --> 05:00.925
Jeon, who shot the probation officers,

05:02.010 --> 05:04.679
had snapped
and was about to commit further crimes.

05:06.139 --> 05:07.140
I concluded

05:08.558 --> 05:10.977
that a quick response was necessary.

05:11.060 --> 05:15.565
Even so, wasn't it a bit excessive
to shoot him so openly?

05:19.736 --> 05:21.362
We checked your record.

05:21.946 --> 05:25.533
It seems you volunteered to serve
only in high-risk conflict zones

05:26.159 --> 05:27.869
that everyone else avoids.

05:29.829 --> 05:32.582
Officially, you've taken down 99 targets.

05:35.877 --> 05:37.712
As of today, the count is 100.

05:42.300 --> 05:44.052
Why would you bring that up here?

05:45.345 --> 05:48.306
Why don't you just be frank with us?

05:51.392 --> 05:54.604
You just wanted to shoot them all down,
didn't you?

05:56.898 --> 05:58.274
Let's not cross the line.

05:58.358 --> 06:01.444
I'm asking because I have a good reason
to be suspicious.

06:10.620 --> 06:11.454
Hey, Lee.

06:12.121 --> 06:14.123
What are you doing here? Step out.

06:14.874 --> 06:17.251
Chief, we're still investigating.

06:17.335 --> 06:19.420
Investigating, my ass. You damn bastards.

06:19.504 --> 06:22.423
Further investigation is needed
to confirm he followed procedure

06:22.507 --> 06:23.633
when using the firearm.

06:23.716 --> 06:25.593
Haven't you seen the security footage?

06:26.094 --> 06:28.346
He saved the lives of 30 fellow officers

06:28.429 --> 06:30.598
and was the only one
who rushed in to help.

06:30.681 --> 06:32.600
You wouldn't have been able
to do anything.

06:32.683 --> 06:36.312
Regardless of the reason,
he fired a weapon with illegal rounds.

06:37.063 --> 06:39.607
We will refer this case
to the disciplinary committee.

06:39.690 --> 06:40.525
Okay, fine.

06:41.818 --> 06:45.238
If you're disciplining a cop
for doing his job, start with me.

06:45.321 --> 06:46.864
All right? I'm his superior.

06:46.948 --> 06:49.784
I gave the orders,
and I'm the one in charge.

06:49.867 --> 06:51.369
I'm in charge, damn it!

06:51.452 --> 06:53.996
Don't even think about
making him a scapegoat!

06:54.080 --> 06:55.998
If you're punishing anyone, start with me!

06:56.082 --> 06:59.001
You bastards would be the first to run
if bullets started flying.

06:59.085 --> 07:00.378
How dare you!

07:01.504 --> 07:02.338
Step out!

07:03.089 --> 07:04.841
INTERROGATION ROOM

07:08.719 --> 07:09.720
I'm sorry.

07:10.263 --> 07:11.514
No need to apologize.

07:12.765 --> 07:15.393
We'll take it from here,
so go get some rest.

07:16.894 --> 07:17.979
Chin up, kid.

07:35.163 --> 07:35.997
Do!

07:36.080 --> 07:38.040
- Captain.
- It must've been tough.

07:43.296 --> 07:45.131
What happened to the shooter?

07:45.214 --> 07:46.424
Wasn't it excessive?

07:46.507 --> 07:48.759
- No comment.
- Where was the gun from?

07:57.435 --> 07:58.978
You didn't have to come.

08:03.774 --> 08:06.694
From your elementary school
to your college graduation,

08:06.777 --> 08:10.948
shooting contests, military enlistment,
deployment overseas, police exam…

08:11.032 --> 08:12.992
Did I miss any of them?

08:15.745 --> 08:16.704
Yes or no?

08:18.122 --> 08:19.081
No.

08:19.165 --> 08:24.378
Then why do you always thank me
in a way that upsets me, kid?

08:25.588 --> 08:27.507
I guess it's good to be consistent.

08:27.590 --> 08:30.092
Say what? Look at this punk yapping.

08:34.597 --> 08:35.932
How is Se-yeong doing?

08:36.015 --> 08:40.311
See? You always change the subject
when you're in a tough spot.

08:40.394 --> 08:43.606
Should you really be worrying
about others right now?

08:43.689 --> 08:46.651
Stop worrying about Se-yeong.
Worry about yourself.

08:52.114 --> 08:54.116
Are you all right?

08:54.992 --> 08:56.410
Why wouldn't I be?

08:57.453 --> 08:59.664
I'm not talking about your tough-ass body.

09:00.957 --> 09:03.292
Are you okay
with having picked up a gun again?

09:05.878 --> 09:08.464
Don't jump in
and get yourself involved, all right?

09:09.507 --> 09:11.842
I can't bear to see you get hurt,

09:12.927 --> 09:14.303
physically or mentally.

09:15.638 --> 09:17.139
Can a police officer say that?

09:17.765 --> 09:20.101
I'm almost 60.
Who cares what anyone thinks?

09:20.184 --> 09:21.227
Of course I can.

09:21.978 --> 09:23.854
I never told you,

09:24.855 --> 09:29.193
but do you know how worried I was
when I heard you picked up a gun?

09:29.277 --> 09:31.362
You don't even know the half of it.

09:52.216 --> 09:54.969
Officially, you've taken down 99 targets.

09:56.262 --> 09:58.264
As of today, the count is 100.

09:58.848 --> 10:01.809
You just wanted to shoot them all down,
didn't you?

10:13.487 --> 10:14.989
Don't be a chicken, little shit.

10:15.072 --> 10:16.240
Hey, the fat ass is here.

10:16.324 --> 10:18.909
Get a move on, dipshit. For fuck's sake.

10:22.455 --> 10:23.414
Seo Yeong-dong.

10:25.166 --> 10:26.459
Wanna try being a bully?

10:27.293 --> 10:28.544
Hey, Fuck-gyu.

10:38.554 --> 10:40.431
You better bring your mom's ID.

10:42.308 --> 10:43.434
You fucker.

10:48.022 --> 10:49.982
Yes, I got it. Yes.

10:50.066 --> 10:52.026
DISCIPLINARY COMMITTEE DECISION

10:52.109 --> 10:53.319
But, you know, this is--

10:54.612 --> 10:56.739
Okay, all right. Understood.

10:59.033 --> 11:01.452
Seriously? A three-month suspension?

11:01.994 --> 11:03.496
Isn't that a bit much?

11:04.205 --> 11:05.956
Man, they're going way too far.

11:07.333 --> 11:09.835
Don't they know
how many lives Officer Lee saved?

11:12.296 --> 11:13.130
Do is here.

11:27.144 --> 11:28.104
Officer Jang.

11:28.896 --> 11:31.899
Did you confirm the identity
of the man who fled from Jeon's house?

11:32.650 --> 11:34.443
Officer Lee, well…

11:34.527 --> 11:37.905
Look, Do. You can't work on anything.

11:38.948 --> 11:42.243
Come on, guys.
Don't be so heartless, seriously.

11:43.035 --> 11:45.871
Officer Lee never said
he was going to do anything.

11:45.955 --> 11:48.040
He was just asking a question, wasn't he?

11:48.124 --> 11:51.836
Doesn't everyone have a question
in mind that they'd like answered?

11:54.088 --> 11:55.089
Actually,

11:55.881 --> 11:57.341
I was curious about that.

11:57.842 --> 12:00.594
Officer Jang, brief me on what happened.

12:00.678 --> 12:02.847
Then, let me give you a rundown, sir.

12:02.930 --> 12:06.100
The guy who fled from Jeon's house.
Did you find out who he was?

12:06.183 --> 12:07.309
He wasn't there!

12:07.393 --> 12:08.936
He wasn't? You little punk.

12:09.019 --> 12:11.564
Be honest, or you'll end up suspended too.

12:11.647 --> 12:12.898
He really wasn't there.

12:13.399 --> 12:16.235
What do you mean?
I told you to go check right away.

12:16.318 --> 12:18.112
He told you to go check right away!

12:18.195 --> 12:20.364
- So I went right away.
- But?

12:20.448 --> 12:23.075
But there were some other guys around.

12:24.910 --> 12:27.037
License plate number and route, please.

12:27.955 --> 12:31.500
Hey, you can just tell me
the license plate number and the route.

12:31.584 --> 12:32.418
Yes, sir.

12:32.501 --> 12:34.587
- The vehicle was someone else's.
- And?

12:34.670 --> 12:39.133
And the plate number
was 1-5-N 2-3-something…

12:42.845 --> 12:44.346
15N 2335?

12:45.139 --> 12:46.056
That's right!

12:46.140 --> 12:48.434
- Move over a bit.
- Yes, sir.

12:51.437 --> 12:52.772
Wait a minute.

12:55.816 --> 12:57.985
That looks just like Jo U-tae, doesn't it?

12:58.068 --> 13:00.154
Right? I was thinking the same thing.

13:02.198 --> 13:03.157
Who's Jo U-tae?

13:03.240 --> 13:05.242
He's a dirtbag who's been causing

13:05.326 --> 13:08.704
all sorts of trouble
in this neighborhood for years.

13:09.955 --> 13:13.042
Didn't he just get out of prison recently?

13:13.125 --> 13:16.003
I recently found out
that he was just killing time

13:16.086 --> 13:17.546
doing odd jobs for Gong.

13:18.047 --> 13:21.425
By Gong, do you mean
Gong Seok-ho from the Glory Gang?

13:21.509 --> 13:22.927
Yeah, that's him!

13:23.010 --> 13:23.886
That's right.

13:23.969 --> 13:28.015
You once worked with Detective Seo
to take him down, right?

13:28.098 --> 13:30.100
Yeah, it's that Gong Seok-ho.

13:31.811 --> 13:34.188
Let's see.

13:35.231 --> 13:38.150
"Today's horoscope for Gong Seok-ho."

13:38.776 --> 13:41.403
"A forgotten enemy will pay you a visit."

13:41.487 --> 13:43.322
"Be careful at all costs."

13:44.031 --> 13:44.865
Damn it.

13:46.492 --> 13:47.993
Damn, that scared me.

13:48.077 --> 13:49.119
POLICE IN NAME ONLY

13:49.203 --> 13:51.121
That horoscope is damn accurate.

13:53.332 --> 13:54.542
That piece of shit.

13:54.625 --> 13:57.753
Hey, Detective Seo, it's me.
Can you tell me where Gong Seok-ho is?

13:57.837 --> 14:01.006
- But, Do, you're--
- I won't do anything. Just checking.

14:01.090 --> 14:03.717
- I'll call you if anything happens.
- All right.

14:04.218 --> 14:07.221
That Moon Baek guy?
I checked, and his record is clean.

14:07.721 --> 14:09.014
- Really?
- Yeah.

14:09.849 --> 14:12.726
All right. Get me Gong Seok-ho's location
as soon as you can.

14:12.810 --> 14:13.644
Thanks.

14:15.771 --> 14:17.356
Here you go, Officer Lee.

14:18.107 --> 14:19.984
Wow, look at this motorbike!

14:20.067 --> 14:20.901
Thank you.

14:21.402 --> 14:23.362
- Can I ask you for a favor?
- Sure.

14:23.445 --> 14:26.323
Could you find out
whatever you can about this person?

14:28.951 --> 14:30.286
I'll find out all I can.

14:30.369 --> 14:31.912
- Drive safely.
- Will do.

14:40.588 --> 14:42.548
"Dongwol Industry. Moon Baek."

14:54.935 --> 14:55.936
Who are you?

14:56.812 --> 14:57.646
Tell me!

14:59.648 --> 15:01.025
Is Mr. Gong Seok-ho inside?

15:01.108 --> 15:03.736
Who do you think you are?
He's not here. Just leave.

15:04.612 --> 15:06.405
Some strange officer is here, causing…

15:07.323 --> 15:08.324
Mr. Gong Seok-ho.

15:11.744 --> 15:14.496
For fuck's sake.
It must be today's horoscope.

15:14.580 --> 15:16.290
Who said you could come in?

15:16.790 --> 15:18.292
Hey, get out of the way.

15:19.501 --> 15:21.712
I'm talking about you, shithead.
Wanna die? Move!

15:21.795 --> 15:23.714
Move already, you dumbasses.

15:23.797 --> 15:25.883
Don't make a fuss. Go on, move!

15:30.679 --> 15:31.764
Goddamn it.

15:35.726 --> 15:38.187
If looks could kill, eh?

15:39.647 --> 15:40.648
Officer Lee.

15:41.482 --> 15:44.401
You should be keeping your area safe.
Why are you here?

15:48.072 --> 15:49.073
Mr. Gong Seok-ho.

15:51.116 --> 15:52.326
You dealing guns lately?

15:52.409 --> 15:53.410
Guns?

15:57.122 --> 15:57.957
Really? Guns?

15:58.999 --> 15:59.959
Seriously.

16:00.459 --> 16:03.295
You barge into my office
just to ask a bullshit question?

16:04.380 --> 16:05.506
Answer me.

16:07.925 --> 16:09.551
Are you dealing guns?

16:09.635 --> 16:12.930
Did you fucking get shot in the head
or something?

16:13.514 --> 16:15.766
Take a look.
Do those look like guns to you?

16:17.643 --> 16:20.771
Hey, have any of you been
playing around with a gun lately?

16:21.271 --> 16:23.399
I mean, even a toy gun?

16:23.482 --> 16:25.150
No, sir!

16:27.611 --> 16:28.529
You heard them?

16:38.080 --> 16:39.164
Do you know this man?

16:42.292 --> 16:43.127
No clue.

16:46.463 --> 16:48.841
I heard he works
for one of your businesses.

16:49.425 --> 16:51.927
Do you realize how many guys work for me?

16:52.011 --> 16:54.638
How could I possibly know them all?

16:56.098 --> 16:57.224
You really don't know?

17:01.020 --> 17:03.480
And you've got nothing else
to tell me about guns?

17:04.064 --> 17:07.443
I know nothing,
and I've got nothing to tell you.

17:09.778 --> 17:13.365
Then I'll start gathering
all the evidence about that case.

17:14.992 --> 17:16.493
If I find any evidence

17:17.911 --> 17:20.247
that you're dealing in guns…

17:22.499 --> 17:23.876
you know what's coming, right?

17:26.545 --> 17:30.007
We might take on every job
that comes our way,

17:30.674 --> 17:33.093
but we're not stupid enough
to get ourselves killed.

17:42.269 --> 17:44.396
You better keep your word.

17:47.441 --> 17:49.193
I warned you.

18:03.332 --> 18:04.458
Who is this bastard?

18:04.541 --> 18:06.335
I've never seen him before.

18:16.470 --> 18:19.389
Can you confirm if this person works here?

18:19.473 --> 18:21.642
TECHNICAL SALES MANAGER, MOON BAEK

18:21.725 --> 18:24.561
I'm sorry.
We can't check that for you right away.

18:25.145 --> 18:26.563
As a defense contractor,

18:26.647 --> 18:29.983
we need time to share employee details,
even with documents.

18:30.067 --> 18:31.151
Officer Lee.

18:31.652 --> 18:33.737
I got Moon Baek's address,
as you requested.

18:33.821 --> 18:35.197
He lives in the Dongjin Apartments.

18:44.706 --> 18:45.541
Hello?

18:46.208 --> 18:47.126
Hey, it's me.

18:47.626 --> 18:50.045
- Hey, what's up?
- You got a minute?

18:50.546 --> 18:52.965
A minute? Of course I do.

18:53.048 --> 18:54.049
Can we talk?

19:16.238 --> 19:18.240
No, do it again. Come on, get up.

19:25.873 --> 19:27.332
Holy shit.

19:27.416 --> 19:30.252
They disguised and shipped real guns
as regular packages?

19:31.170 --> 19:32.171
So fucking reckless.

19:33.505 --> 19:34.339
Why not?

19:35.299 --> 19:36.925
It's super safe and not suspicious.

19:37.509 --> 19:38.760
They're actually clever.

19:38.844 --> 19:41.847
Have you ever seen anyone in Korea
steal someone else's package?

19:41.930 --> 19:44.057
People follow it like it's the law, man.

19:44.141 --> 19:45.767
Tell us more about those people.

19:47.853 --> 19:49.354
I don't know much either.

19:49.897 --> 19:52.774
But I have to say,
their charisma was just off the charts.

19:53.400 --> 19:54.735
How many guns were there?

19:56.195 --> 19:57.321
A shitload of them.

19:57.863 --> 19:59.615
Around ten truckloads?

19:59.698 --> 20:00.699
Ten truckloads?

20:01.283 --> 20:04.411
Yeah, but we only brought
about half a truckload.

20:04.494 --> 20:05.746
How did you contact them?

20:05.829 --> 20:08.207
What was it again? Oh yeah, Telegram.

20:08.290 --> 20:11.126
- But they only reach out when they want.
- Give me your phone.

20:12.211 --> 20:14.046
Gong Seok-ho took my phone.

20:14.129 --> 20:16.715
Can't even play games when I'm bored,
that son of a bitch.

20:18.008 --> 20:20.177
Hey, did you check the storage room?

20:21.011 --> 20:21.845
It was locked.

20:22.429 --> 20:25.432
Okay. That means Gong Seok-ho
hasn't checked it yet either.

20:26.266 --> 20:27.100
The address list?

20:27.809 --> 20:30.187
We should be cautious until we're sure,

20:30.270 --> 20:33.607
especially since our boys ran into a pig
at that gosiwon.

20:33.690 --> 20:34.524
Hey.

20:35.734 --> 20:40.197
The fact that a cop was involved confirms
there are guns at those addresses.

20:40.280 --> 20:41.448
- Got it?
- Fucking hell.

20:41.531 --> 20:43.283
You're all so damn clueless.

20:49.373 --> 20:50.666
GONG SEOK-HO

20:50.749 --> 20:51.875
That fucking bitch.

20:51.959 --> 20:54.795
Gong Seok-ho, that fucker.
Why is he calling you?

20:58.507 --> 21:00.842
Jeong-man.

21:01.510 --> 21:03.971
The person you're calling is unavailable.

21:04.054 --> 21:06.098
Please try again later.

21:07.724 --> 21:09.851
This fucking asshole.

21:15.732 --> 21:17.818
What's going on? Why did Gong call?

21:19.111 --> 21:20.028
Has he caught on?

21:20.112 --> 21:21.154
Come on, Jeong-man.

21:21.738 --> 21:23.907
What are you hesitating for?

21:24.491 --> 21:26.743
Good thing I had one squirreled away.

21:26.827 --> 21:30.914
If he finds out there are guns
in that storage room, we're all fucked.

21:32.291 --> 21:33.625
Hey, let's move fast.

21:33.709 --> 21:35.794
Whoever gets there first grabs the guns.

21:40.507 --> 21:41.341
Let's…

21:43.468 --> 21:44.761
take those guns.

21:44.845 --> 21:47.055
- That's right.
- For fuck's sake.

21:47.139 --> 21:49.850
Find them all and bring them here.
Don't leave any behind.

21:50.600 --> 21:52.561
Hurry up and bring them all here!

21:53.270 --> 21:54.896
- Move fast!
- Shit. Let's go.

21:54.980 --> 21:56.940
Come on. Move it, you bastard!

21:57.024 --> 21:57.858
Move now!

21:57.941 --> 21:59.443
Guys! Let's go!

21:59.526 --> 22:00.652
- Let's go!
- Yes, sir!

22:00.736 --> 22:01.695
Come on, let's go!

22:09.036 --> 22:12.664
Goodness me.
The rice today is cooked to perfection.

22:15.667 --> 22:17.210
Oh my. That looks good.

22:21.798 --> 22:23.258
LISTEN TO MY DEAD SON'S MESSAGE!

22:23.342 --> 22:24.926
APOLOGIZE!
BAN DANGEROUS OUTSOURCING

22:28.138 --> 22:31.266
Sir! I just want to talk to you.

22:32.059 --> 22:32.893
I just want to…

22:32.976 --> 22:34.644
You still haven't taken care of her?

22:34.728 --> 22:38.148
I just want to talk to you.
What's so hard about that?

22:52.037 --> 22:54.498
Hey, why is the floor so slippery?

22:54.581 --> 22:57.000
- Oh no, are you okay?
- Damn, dude.

22:57.084 --> 22:59.836
This bastard always eats his lunch
with his freaking head.

22:59.920 --> 23:00.837
Looks so damn good.

23:37.374 --> 23:39.209
Hey, Fuck-gyu. You're not gonna answer?

23:39.292 --> 23:41.336
You want us to visit
your mom's restaurant?

23:41.420 --> 23:43.463
You want to lose
the one parent you got left?

23:43.547 --> 23:44.506
He'll be an orphan?

23:44.589 --> 23:46.425
- Is his dad dead?
- You didn't know?

23:46.508 --> 23:48.802
So that's why Fuck-gyu's such a dumbass.

23:48.885 --> 23:50.303
I feel bad for your mom.

23:50.387 --> 23:51.930
- Answer.
- You still don't get it?

23:52.013 --> 23:55.308
If I ever see you, you're dead.
You fucking loser.

23:57.853 --> 23:58.687
Damn it.

24:09.990 --> 24:12.451
Excuse me. Do you live in Unit 1311?

25:07.422 --> 25:09.216
Hey, you're here. Want some?

25:20.310 --> 25:22.020
What did you do at Dongwol Industry?

25:25.315 --> 25:28.777
Well, I was always designing
and testing new bullets.

25:30.779 --> 25:31.613
Did you know?

25:32.572 --> 25:34.533
South Korea, a gun-free country,

25:34.616 --> 25:37.410
is actually one
of the largest bullet exporters?

25:38.453 --> 25:39.746
Isn't it ironic?

25:45.794 --> 25:47.754
What were you going to do with the gun?

25:50.966 --> 25:52.008
Well, about that…

25:53.510 --> 25:54.761
I don't really wanna say.

26:07.440 --> 26:08.358
Fine.

26:10.777 --> 26:13.488
I have cancer.
They say I'll die in six months.

26:14.573 --> 26:15.740
Maybe even less.

26:17.492 --> 26:18.743
You don't believe me?

26:24.416 --> 26:25.250
Look.

26:26.167 --> 26:27.669
They cut me open three times.

26:28.545 --> 26:32.090
It's in my blood, spreading everywhere.

26:33.133 --> 26:35.510
First, Seoul.

26:36.845 --> 26:38.680
Then Busan.

26:39.598 --> 26:41.725
From Busan to Gwangju.

26:46.730 --> 26:48.231
This thing called cancer.

26:49.858 --> 26:51.693
Man, it really

26:52.819 --> 26:53.945
hurts like hell.

26:55.488 --> 27:00.368
So I was gonna leave this world
with a bang.

27:07.834 --> 27:09.544
But all you had were bullets.

27:10.629 --> 27:12.005
Where did you get them?

27:12.505 --> 27:17.093
While looking into handmade guns online
so I could go out with a bang,

27:17.177 --> 27:21.181
I stumbled upon a weird website
claiming to be handing out free guns.

27:21.681 --> 27:24.309
I figured I'd give it a go
and clicked on it.

27:25.352 --> 27:26.811
PRESS HERE IF YOU WANT A GUN

27:26.895 --> 27:30.982
A couple of days later,
I really did get a package.

27:32.025 --> 27:34.778
But the annoying thing was
that there were no guns.

27:34.861 --> 27:37.906
All it had was a piece of paper
and a bunch of bullets.

27:40.992 --> 27:43.036
Try going to that website again.

27:45.914 --> 27:47.791
I'd like to do that as well.

27:50.460 --> 27:52.295
But I can't.

27:53.254 --> 27:54.631
The website is gone.

27:54.714 --> 27:56.132
UNABLE TO CONNECT
PLEASE TRY AGAIN

27:57.175 --> 28:01.137
So I checked the piece of paper
that came in the package.

28:01.638 --> 28:05.141
It had the addresses of people
who ordered guns, just like I did.

28:05.725 --> 28:09.688
I randomly went to one of them,
just in case.

28:09.771 --> 28:10.772
To get a gun.

28:13.024 --> 28:14.693
Where's that address list now?

28:16.569 --> 28:17.737
I threw it out.

28:19.447 --> 28:20.448
I threw it out.

28:20.949 --> 28:22.325
You expect me to believe that?

28:22.409 --> 28:25.161
But I've got a really good memory.

28:25.245 --> 28:26.496
It's all in here.

28:28.498 --> 28:29.332
I see.

28:32.502 --> 28:34.295
If your memory is that good,

28:35.422 --> 28:37.048
the addresses in your head…

28:41.010 --> 28:42.053
Write them all here.

28:44.764 --> 28:46.266
Yes, sir.

29:00.238 --> 29:04.284
DOMYEONG-RO 1-GIL, DONGAN-GU, GYEONGIN

29:09.038 --> 29:09.873
What?

29:09.956 --> 29:11.583
Are you sure about these addresses?

29:13.793 --> 29:14.794
Yeah.

29:18.798 --> 29:19.632
Hey!

29:20.425 --> 29:22.218
Where are you going? Damn it.

29:23.803 --> 29:26.264
MRS. OH

29:27.140 --> 29:29.768
The person you're calling is unavailable.

29:33.813 --> 29:34.939
Oh man.

29:36.483 --> 29:38.234
What is it this time?

29:40.487 --> 29:41.988
- Damn it.
- Sir.

29:42.071 --> 29:43.782
How long must I avoid these people?

29:43.865 --> 29:45.492
Sir, please look here!

29:45.575 --> 29:47.285
Is it so hard to get rid of them?

29:47.368 --> 29:49.204
They're not exactly breaking the law.

29:49.704 --> 29:51.206
I'll sort them out quickly.

29:54.417 --> 29:56.461
- Damn it.
- I'm so sorry, sir.

29:57.170 --> 29:59.964
- Drive properly, for God's sake.
- Sorry, she jumped out.

30:00.048 --> 30:02.717
Sir. Please get out.

30:03.343 --> 30:04.552
I just want to talk.

30:05.220 --> 30:06.054
Who is that?

30:06.763 --> 30:08.306
Have you lost your mind?

30:08.807 --> 30:11.476
You know who you're talking to?
Out of the way!

30:11.559 --> 30:15.605
Is it really that hard to apologize?
I just want to talk to you!

30:15.688 --> 30:18.983
- What should I do?
- What else? Just keep driving.

30:19.067 --> 30:21.569
- Keep driving?
- What, you want me to do it?

30:22.070 --> 30:22.904
Go, you bastard.

30:24.030 --> 30:26.491
I said keep going. Go!

30:28.952 --> 30:30.161
Hey, why'd you stop?

30:30.245 --> 30:32.747
- Ma'am, please…
- Do your damn job! You useless fucker.

30:37.126 --> 30:37.961
Go!

30:40.630 --> 30:42.757
What's that crazy bitch pulling out?

30:43.800 --> 30:45.009
- A gun?
- Huh?

30:45.510 --> 30:46.344
Sir…

30:46.427 --> 30:48.137
Look at that crazy bitch.

31:02.068 --> 31:03.361
What's this?

31:16.332 --> 31:18.167
ORDERER ADDRESS LIST
INFORMATION

31:18.251 --> 31:19.085
OH KYEONG-SUK

31:28.803 --> 31:30.513
- I'm sorry, sir!
- Ji-ung.

31:31.014 --> 31:33.016
- Ji-ung! Hey, Ji-ung!
- Sir.

31:35.602 --> 31:37.687
You know Hwang Min-ju, right?

31:38.187 --> 31:40.607
Who is Hwang Min-ju? I have no idea!

31:51.492 --> 31:52.410
You don't know?

31:53.286 --> 31:54.412
Why don't you know?

31:55.079 --> 31:56.080
How?

31:57.040 --> 31:59.167
How could you not know Hwang Min-ju?

31:59.918 --> 32:01.044
You, of all people…

32:02.086 --> 32:03.046
How could you…

32:03.630 --> 32:08.051
For God's sake,
I don't know who Hwang Min-ju is!

32:08.551 --> 32:10.553
He was one of your employees.

32:12.055 --> 32:13.056
He's my son,

32:13.848 --> 32:15.183
the one you overworked

32:16.351 --> 32:17.810
to save money,

32:18.603 --> 32:22.565
leaving his body torn in two.

32:24.567 --> 32:28.905
I've been screaming his name
at the top of my lungs this whole time.

32:31.115 --> 32:33.368
What a joke we must've been to you.

32:34.160 --> 32:36.704
How lowly must we have been in your eyes

32:37.747 --> 32:41.709
for you not to even know
my dead son's name?

32:43.586 --> 32:48.424
Spare me, please.
Just this once, please spare my life.

32:50.093 --> 32:52.971
Please don't kill me. I'm sorry.

32:53.554 --> 32:57.892
Please spare my life. I'm sorry.

33:00.812 --> 33:02.188
Don't apologize to me.

33:05.316 --> 33:06.901
Apologize to my son.

33:24.168 --> 33:26.004
Mrs. Oh, why didn't you answer?

33:26.504 --> 33:27.797
Officer Lee.

33:31.175 --> 33:32.385
Finally,

33:33.428 --> 33:35.013
I got my apology today.

33:38.474 --> 33:40.476
No matter how much I screamed,

33:40.977 --> 33:43.062
he never listened.

33:43.813 --> 33:45.231
But he gave in so easily

33:46.774 --> 33:48.735
when I pulled a gun.

33:49.444 --> 33:50.278
Mrs. Oh.

33:50.862 --> 33:51.863
Yes, I know.

33:53.948 --> 33:55.324
What I did was wrong.

33:56.993 --> 34:00.413
Now that I got my apology,

34:01.956 --> 34:03.875
I should pay for what I did too.

34:05.293 --> 34:06.586
Officer Lee.

34:07.712 --> 34:10.089
Let me make

34:10.673 --> 34:13.926
one last meal for my son.

34:26.689 --> 34:30.318
Min-ju, eat up.

34:32.111 --> 34:33.362
I made him

34:34.655 --> 34:36.115
apologize to you today.

34:38.076 --> 34:39.202
I don't think…

34:43.164 --> 34:45.958
I can cook for you for a while.

34:50.338 --> 34:51.339
I'm sorry.

35:02.975 --> 35:04.185
Officer Lee?

35:17.615 --> 35:18.616
Who are you?

35:19.283 --> 35:20.409
Hey, lady.

35:21.119 --> 35:21.953
Yes?

35:23.204 --> 35:24.580
You have a gun, don't you?

35:39.178 --> 35:41.430
What is it? You recognize that car?

35:42.181 --> 35:43.599
Keep an eye on that car.

36:21.679 --> 36:22.763
MRS. OH

36:57.506 --> 36:59.133
OFFICER LEE DO

37:05.765 --> 37:06.599
Oh man.

37:07.642 --> 37:09.977
I'm curious. So curious.

37:14.732 --> 37:17.693
LISTEN TO MY DEAD SON'S MESSAGE!

37:32.917 --> 37:34.335
Moon Baek never holds back.

37:44.262 --> 37:46.847
- Shit. What the hell?
- That fucking scared me.

37:46.931 --> 37:48.474
- What's up with him?
- Fucking hell!

37:50.226 --> 37:52.061
I told you not to park here.

37:52.687 --> 37:53.521
And who are you?

37:53.604 --> 37:55.147
Me? I'm Moon Baek.

37:55.231 --> 37:56.565
- Don't.
- You fucking asshole.

37:56.649 --> 37:59.026
So why did you park
on this freaking narrow street

37:59.110 --> 38:00.903
and block others from passing?

38:07.118 --> 38:10.621
Holy fuck.
So we meet again, you son of a bitch.

38:16.085 --> 38:17.044
Face the camera.

38:17.128 --> 38:19.130
I wanna take a picture for your funeral.

38:19.213 --> 38:20.172
Say kimchi.

38:21.007 --> 38:23.718
Okay, we got it. Now get lost.

38:25.845 --> 38:27.430
- Huh?
- What is it?

38:27.513 --> 38:28.514
What is this?

38:29.140 --> 38:30.224
Who is this?

38:31.684 --> 38:34.312
- The hell you looking at?
- We got it. Get lost already!

38:34.395 --> 38:37.523
Yeah, I got it. Now you guys get lost too!

38:37.606 --> 38:38.441
What was that?

38:38.524 --> 38:40.192
- Unless you wanna die here.
- What?

38:40.276 --> 38:42.528
- You fucking asshole.
- What the hell?

38:42.611 --> 38:45.031
That bastard saw our faces. Is that okay?

38:45.114 --> 38:46.824
Of course not. Get out.

38:47.616 --> 38:50.286
Man, this just keeps getting
more interesting.

38:51.954 --> 38:54.248
You! Come here.

38:54.332 --> 38:55.624
Where you going?

38:55.708 --> 38:56.959
Hold up. You fucker.

38:57.752 --> 39:00.171
How are you gonna make us die?
He got scared.

39:01.630 --> 39:02.465
Hey!

39:02.548 --> 39:04.008
That fucker, look at his eyes.

39:04.091 --> 39:05.343
Hey!

39:05.426 --> 39:07.762
You bastard!
I'm gonna rip out all your hair!

39:09.180 --> 39:10.681
- Crazy son of a bitch.
- Hey!

39:10.765 --> 39:12.475
- Hey!
- Get him!

39:12.558 --> 39:13.726
You son of a bitch!

39:13.809 --> 39:15.394
- You bastard.
- Stop!

39:16.187 --> 39:18.230
- You son of a bitch!
- Stop!

39:19.565 --> 39:20.775
Where are you going?

39:23.527 --> 39:25.738
- Where is she?
- You fucker.

39:25.821 --> 39:28.574
You're gonna fucking die soon.
Worry about yourself.

39:42.546 --> 39:43.589
Gong made you do this?

39:44.090 --> 39:47.093
Man, this guy has no fucking clue
what he's dealing with.

39:47.593 --> 39:49.011
This is a real fucking gun.

39:49.095 --> 39:51.889
If I pull the trigger,
I'll blow your head off.

39:51.972 --> 39:52.890
Holy fuck.

39:56.519 --> 39:58.104
That fucking crazy bitch.

40:00.439 --> 40:01.273
Huh?

40:01.774 --> 40:03.150
What? What is it?

40:04.777 --> 40:05.611
Huh?

40:10.449 --> 40:12.201
One more car.

40:33.889 --> 40:35.224
Fuck!

40:40.146 --> 40:41.564
Fucking hell!

40:47.111 --> 40:49.280
You can't even tell blanks
from live rounds.

40:49.864 --> 40:51.907
Fucking shit! Kill him!

40:55.995 --> 40:56.954
Fuck!

41:05.296 --> 41:06.672
Seriously!

41:31.322 --> 41:32.448
U-tae is calling.

41:32.531 --> 41:33.365
Hey, U-tae.

41:33.449 --> 41:34.992
Get in here, all of you.

41:37.661 --> 41:39.038
Grab your tools and go inside.

41:39.121 --> 41:41.332
- Get ready to take care of the guy.
- Let's move.

41:42.625 --> 41:43.501
Hey, hurry.

41:43.584 --> 41:45.085
Guys, get in the house now.

41:46.128 --> 41:48.672
Shit, we're totally fucked.
Hey, come out already!

41:48.756 --> 41:49.840
Come on, hurry!

42:02.186 --> 42:03.312
Shit.

42:12.863 --> 42:13.697
Fuck!

42:26.293 --> 42:27.253
Mrs. Oh.

42:35.010 --> 42:36.971
I'll be back soon. Hang in there.

42:45.479 --> 42:47.481
Goddamn it. Fuck.

42:53.404 --> 42:55.656
I told you to get the gun ready.
What's the delay?

42:55.739 --> 42:57.241
Hey, hurry up!

42:57.324 --> 42:58.659
- Come on.
- Seriously.

43:02.746 --> 43:05.416
- Why does he keep coming back?
- He's a total nutjob.

43:15.593 --> 43:16.802
- Hey!
- Incoming!

43:20.389 --> 43:22.933
Man, what a bunch of cowards.

43:24.810 --> 43:25.853
- Get him!
- Fuck!

43:41.118 --> 43:42.119
Fucking hell!

44:07.144 --> 44:08.562
Damn it!

44:20.699 --> 44:21.867
Hey! Fuck you!

44:27.581 --> 44:28.666
You!

44:32.795 --> 44:34.338
- Let go! Hey, my hair!
- Hey!

44:34.421 --> 44:37.591
- Where the fuck is everyone?
- Where are you going?

44:51.730 --> 44:53.816
You fuckers!

44:54.650 --> 44:57.695
Let go! I said let go, you bastard!

44:57.778 --> 44:58.696
I said let go!

45:12.000 --> 45:13.001
Goddamn it!

45:21.051 --> 45:22.302
This is why

45:22.386 --> 45:23.762
you should

45:23.846 --> 45:25.013
park your car

45:26.181 --> 45:27.766
properly!

45:39.361 --> 45:41.029
You fucking bastard.

45:43.699 --> 45:44.950
Fuck this shit.

45:57.045 --> 45:58.172
Let go, motherfucker.

45:58.255 --> 45:59.590
Let go. I said let go of me.

45:59.673 --> 46:01.133
You fucker, I said let go.

46:01.216 --> 46:02.634
I'm gonna kill you.

46:07.681 --> 46:09.391
- Shit, what's this?
- What the fuck?

46:10.893 --> 46:12.186
Who the hell are you?

46:29.620 --> 46:31.955
- What's up? Is she hurt?
- Moon Baek, open the door.

46:39.755 --> 46:40.589
Press here.

46:40.672 --> 46:41.840
- I'll drive.
- Okay.

47:08.659 --> 47:10.077
You'll be fine, Mrs. Oh.

47:10.661 --> 47:12.496
Hold on just a little longer.

47:12.996 --> 47:14.414
Everything will be okay.

47:14.498 --> 47:16.750
We're almost there.

47:18.210 --> 47:20.546
He turned right at 96 Geumseong-ro
five minutes ago.

47:20.629 --> 47:23.465
- Huh? No, he turned left.
- Stop. That was 96 Geumseong-ro.

47:25.425 --> 47:26.260
SECURITY CAMERA CONTROL ROOM

47:26.343 --> 47:27.427
MRS. OH

47:28.136 --> 47:29.263
Hold on.

47:31.139 --> 47:31.974
Hello, Mrs. Oh.

47:32.057 --> 47:34.643
I have an urgent matter.
Can I call you back?

47:34.726 --> 47:37.229
Of course. I'm sorry to interrupt.

47:39.606 --> 47:40.941
I'm back. Go ahead.

48:06.425 --> 48:07.259
Mrs. Oh.

48:08.218 --> 48:09.636
Careful. Watch her head.

48:11.930 --> 48:13.640
Mrs. Oh, you'll be all right.

48:13.724 --> 48:15.350
We're here. Stay strong.

48:15.851 --> 48:17.936
Mrs. Oh, can you hear me?

48:18.812 --> 48:21.940
You need to stay awake, okay?
Everything will be fine.

48:38.332 --> 48:39.499
OPERATION ROOM

52:45.370 --> 52:50.375
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
